========================================================

Implement a Mathematics-specific validation stage that checks every mathematical expression and every numerical answer before a lesson or resource is presented as complete.

The current output contains expressions with missing multiplication symbols, including examples resembling:

45 + 5 2³

5 [2 (3² + 1)] 4

6 + 12 ÷ 3 + 2 4

These expressions are ambiguous or incorrectly formatted.

